WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Meet your workspace. Connect, answer the setup questions, and enter your day.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.100
Connect your workspace. Sign in through the browser and choose your team.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.600
Finish the setup steps. Confirm your profile, schedule and privacy choices.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.000
Enter My Day. Your workspace is ready when setup is complete.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.200
You are set up. Your workspace is ready for the first day.
